; The Meadow Path: the head of the valley in the stopped evening, the
; Spire up the rise. Light from the low sun in the notch (left of centre);
; shadows fall long to the right. Painted back to front; then, in layers
; (spec/page.md §page.layers): Clementine with and without her key, Ysolde
; (@actor), and copies of what stands in front of her (boulder, fence).
; Units are screen units; the scene fills the top 320 rows of the screen.
